- and they grew so much. - They grew again?

1803
01:07:29,418 --> 01:07:31,978
So he covered them to use as fertilizer.

1804
01:07:32,078 --> 01:07:33,717
Oh, you need to harvest them fast.

1805
01:07:33,718 --> 01:07:35,557
Yes, so it was right of him to harvest when they were good.

1806
01:07:35,558 --> 01:07:37,088
You need to harvest them in time.

1807
01:07:38,088 --> 01:07:39,587
I thought you were going to harvest only as much as you need,

1808
01:07:39,588 --> 01:07:40,688
- but you keep going. - What do I do?

1809
01:07:40,888 --> 01:07:42,028
I shouldn't be greedy.

1810
