1875
01:09:55,358 --> 01:09:57,258
The most similar dish is radish soup.

1876
01:09:57,358 --> 01:09:59,298
- It's Gyeongsang's style, - I know radish soup.

1877
01:09:59,768 --> 01:10:02,551
but it doesn't have as much broth as radish soup.

1878
01:10:02,868 --> 01:10:04,468
It's slightly soupy,

1879
01:10:05,038 --> 01:10:06,307
so it's called seolchi soup with seasoned vegetables...

1880
01:10:06,308 --> 01:10:07,567
- With seasoned vegetables? - or just seolchi soup.

1881
01:10:07,568 --> 01:10:09,808
That's how it's called.

1882
01:10:11,178 --> 01:10:13,377
Let's use seasoned fish-meat paste for soy sauce today.

1883
01:10:13,378 --> 01:10:14,407
All right.

1884
01:10:14,408 --> 01:10:15,448
Seasoned fish-meat paste?

1885
01:10:16,478 --> 01:10:17,877
Gosh, it's warm here too.

1886
01:10:17,878 --> 01:10:18,878
(Striding to the rooftop)

1887
01:10:18,879 --> 01:10:19,988
It's so nice.

1888
01:10:21,518 --> 01:10:25,788
(Filled with pastes made with decades of effort)

1889
01:10:26,788 --> 01:10:27,857
It's his treasure.

1890
01:10:27,858 --> 01:10:29,327
(The master's treasure rooftop)

1891
01:10:29,328 --> 01:10:31,328
The codfish is dried well, right?

1892
01:10:31,658 --> 01:10:33,368
- So he dried codfish. - It's well-dried, seriously.

1893
01:10:33,968 --> 01:10:34,968
Here.

1894
01:10:37,168 --> 01:10:38,868
- The codfish is huge. - This is incredible.

1895
01:10:39,438 --> 01:10:41,538
(Hude codfish)

1896
01:10:42,238 --> 01:10:44,037
The master dried them himself.

1897
01:10:44,038 --> 01:10:45,308
It's called medicinal codfish.

1898
01:10:45,438 --> 01:10:48,448
They'd collect three codfish's worth of codfish roe.

1899
01:10:48,678 --> 01:10:51,178
Then they'd put all of them in one codfish...

1900
01:10:51,518 --> 01:10:54,088
- and dry it in its stomach. - They'd ferment it.

1901
01:10:54,448 --> 01:10:56,317
- The stomach would burst. - If you dry this,

1902
01:10:56,318 --> 01:10:57,658
- Medicinal codfish. - it's really delicious.

1903
01:10:58,188 --> 01:10:59,957
I told you I made this last time.

1904
01:10:59,958 --> 01:11:01,227
(Let's check this one too.)

1905
01:11:01,228 --> 01:11:02,288
This time...

1906
01:11:03,728 --> 01:11:06,097
(Soy sauce made with dried codfish)

1907
01:11:06,098 --> 01:11:07,827
Soy sauce made with codfish?

1908
01:11:07,828 --> 01:11:08,928
(Fascinated)

1909
01:11:09,568 --> 01:11:11,237
- It's clear. - I can't even imagine...

1910
01:11:11,238 --> 01:11:12,438
