1954
01:12:55,238 --> 01:12:56,808
(Happy)

1955
01:12:57,438 --> 01:13:00,408
(Thoroughly prepping sea cucumbers)

1956
01:13:01,508 --> 01:13:02,718
Si Hyeon, you're good.

1957
01:13:04,218 --> 01:13:05,948
