1962
01:13:16,728 --> 01:13:17,858
Oh, it's slightly blanched.

1963
01:13:17,958 --> 01:13:19,298
It becomes really firm and crunchy.

1964
01:13:20,598 --> 01:13:22,698
Si Hyeon, you'll make seasoned radish.

1965
01:13:23,498 --> 01:13:24,837
- Oysters? - Try stir-frying oysters.

1966
01:13:24,838 --> 01:13:25,968
- Do I use this? All of them? - Put all of them in.

1967
