1974
01:13:43,088 --> 01:13:45,788
We stir-fried radish to use as the base for seolchi soup.

1975
01:13:45,928 --> 01:13:47,427
That's what we're doing.

1976
01:13:47,428 --> 01:13:48,528
- So you use that broth. - Yes.

1977
01:13:48,888 --> 01:13:50,298
That's because oyster isn't rare there.

1978
01:13:51,058 --> 01:13:52,358
- They brim with oysters. - And it's delicious.

1979
01:13:53,598 --> 01:13:55,898
(Pouring fish-meat soy sauce they got from the crock)

1980
01:13:55,968 --> 01:13:58,438
In any case, it's good if it makes broth. Done.

1981
01:13:58,498 --> 01:14:00,037
(It'll be done if you wait until oyster and radish mix well.)

1982
01:14:00,038 --> 01:14:01,967
Anything made in that pot is good.

1983
01:14:01,968 --> 01:14:03,038
Exactly.

1984
01:14:03,378 --> 01:14:06,078
That's done. Now, let's steam hairy crabs.

1985
01:14:06,278 --> 01:14:07,577
- Like this. - Flip them.

1986
01:14:07,578 --> 01:14:08,807
