1987
01:14:08,808 --> 01:14:10,718
- So they're being steamed. - Oh, the crabs from earlier?

1988
01:14:11,348 --> 01:14:12,688
After cleaning the live ones.

1989
01:14:13,788 --> 01:14:14,887
(The seasonal hairy crabs from Tongyeong's ocean...)

1990
01:14:14,888 --> 01:14:16,818
