1993
01:14:22,528 --> 01:14:23,657
The aroma will be gone, though.

1994
01:14:23,658 --> 01:14:24,698
You should steam siler divaricata.

1995
01:14:25,228 --> 01:14:26,468
Oh, you should steam siler divaricata.

1996
01:14:26,728 --> 01:14:28,298
(Fragrant)

1997
01:14:28,928 --> 01:14:31,798
Please season seaweed and spinach.

1998
01:14:32,568 --> 01:14:34,768
