1999
01:14:35,008 --> 01:14:36,177
It must be delicious, right?

2000
01:14:36,178 --> 01:14:37,738
(Lightly seasoning it to prep it)

2001
01:14:38,578 --> 01:14:41,508
(Let's see if the radish is cooked.)

2002
01:14:42,478 --> 01:14:43,717
It smells delicious.

2003
01:14:43,718 --> 01:14:45,447
(The radish is perfectly cooked for seolchi soup.)

2004
01:14:45,448 --> 01:14:46,648
Gosh, it smells amazing.

2005
01:14:49,118 --> 01:14:52,058
(Striding up to the lab)

2006
01:14:53,988 --> 01:14:55,657
(Struggling)

2007
01:14:55,658 --> 01:14:57,128
It was hot, that's why.

2008
01:14:58,058 --> 01:14:59,128
There was no doorknob.

2009
01:15:00,228 --> 01:15:03,538
(Opening the door easily with quick thinking)

2010
01:15:04,268 --> 01:15:07,538
(Entering the lab safely)

2011
01:15:09,508 --> 01:15:10,537
It's only beginning now.

2012
01:15:10,538 --> 01:15:13,608
(Si Hyeon sets up the ingredients one by one.)

2013
01:15:14,748 --> 01:15:16,477
(They're ready for the culinary research in earnest.)

2014
01:15:16,478 --> 01:15:18,117
I'm really curious how it'll taste with hairy crabs and everything.

2015
01:15:18,118 --> 01:15:19,517
(Ingredients for seolchi soup and siler divaricata tangpyeongchae)

2016
01:15:19,518 --> 01:15:20,548
All right.

2017
01:15:21,248 --> 01:15:22,488
(Opening)

2018
01:15:23,388 --> 01:15:24,388
