2025
01:15:38,798 --> 01:15:40,008
That sounds like a good idea.

2026
01:15:41,468 --> 01:15:42,638
What shall we start with, Si Hyeon?

2027
01:15:42,878 --> 01:15:44,237
With seolchi soup.

2028
01:15:44,238 --> 01:15:45,238
